  ClassIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 649d7f1106f7c844f854cf316999fbb8, type: 3}
  Description: The battlefield leader. His stance inspires every ally around him;
    in offensive stance he grips his spear with both hands, strikes from mid range
    and hurls it to stun enemies. He leaps into the fray and plants his banner.
  DescriptionEs: "El l\xEDder del campo de batalla. Su postura inspira a todos los
    aliados a su alrededor; en postura ofensiva toma la lanza a dos manos, golpea
    a media distancia y la arroja para aturdir. Salta a la pelea y planta su estandarte."
